## Hook Analysis
<!-- HOOK_START -->
**Hook Type:** Contrarian
**Analysis:** The opening establishes a counterintuitive claim: Peter McCrory no longer believes his comparative advantage over Claude lies in knowing which questions to ask—a reversal of what he thought six months ago. This challenges the common assumption that human judgment in question-formulation remains a defensible edge against AI capabilities.
