## Description

FULL INTERVIEW: Peter McCrory says 6 months ago he thought his edge over Claude was knowing which question to ask. He no longer thinks that. His team is now working on 3 singularities: software, economic, and Coasean.  @PeterMcCrory is Head of Economics at @AnthropicAI and leads https://t.co/cHQZI6LeFE

